Subject: [PATCH 0971/3799] soh: rename func_808783AC -> BgGateShutter_Settle

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: waits out the 30-frame timer set by the two slide actions, clears openingState and returns to the idle action.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Gate_Shutter/z_bg_gate_shutter.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Gate_Shutter/z_bg_gate_shutter.c       | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Gate_Shutter/z_bg_gate_shutter.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Gate_Shutter/z_bg_gate_shutter.c
index 727d3e297..f0a536e7d 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Gate_Shutter/z_bg_gate_shutter.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Gate_Shutter/z_bg_gate_shutter.c
